From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtl8192fs: adapt the driver to Linux 7.3

Replace removed string, timer, NAPI, kthread, random and crypto
helpers, disable the GRO path that uses GRO_DROP, rename the local
hmac_sha256 to avoid the kernel symbol, and add 7.3 cfg80211
wrappers for the wireless_dev/link_id/radio_idx and scalar cookie ABI.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/core/crypto/sha256.c
+++ b/core/crypto/sha256.c
@@ -97,7 +97,7 @@
  * @mac: Buffer for the hash (32 bytes)
  * Returns: 0 on success, -1 on failure
  */
-int hmac_sha256(const u8 *key, size_t key_len, const u8 *data,
+int rtw_hmac_sha256(const u8 *key, size_t key_len, const u8 *data,
 		size_t data_len, u8 *mac)
 {
 	return hmac_sha256_vector(key, key_len, 1, &data, &data_len, mac);
